{
  "id": "after-school-homework",
  "title": "放學後寫功課",
  "titleEn": "Doing Homework After School",
  "category": "學習與生活",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/after-school-homework.webp",
    "alt": "放學後，小男孩坐在書桌前的椅子上認真看著數學作業簿，爸爸面帶微笑坐在旁邊親切指點，桌上整齊擺放著鉛筆與檯燈。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After school, Ben sits on a "
        },
        {
          "text": "chair",
          "wordIds": [
            "chair"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " at his "
        },
        {
          "text": "desk",
          "wordIds": [
            "desk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "放學後，Ben 坐在書桌前的椅子上。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He opens his workbook to do his "
        },
        {
          "text": "homework",
          "wordIds": [
            "homework"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他打開練習本開始寫功課。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "One "
        },
        {
          "text": "math",
          "wordIds": [
            "math"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "question",
          "wordIds": [
            "question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is hard, so Ben thinks carefully."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "有一題數學題目很難，所以 Ben 認真思考。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ben looks at his dad and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can you help me?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-you-help-me"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ben 看著爸爸問：「你可以幫我嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Dad smiles warmly and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me see.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "let-me-see"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "爸爸親切地微笑著說：「讓我看看。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Dad helps him step by step, and Ben happily says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I am ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-finished"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "finished",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-finished"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "finished"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-finished"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "爸爸一步步引導他，Ben 開心地說：「我做完了。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Dad gives him a high five and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Good job!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "good-job"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "爸爸和他擊掌並說：「做得好！」"
    }
  ],
